x20//\x20come\x20in\x20two\x20OPPOSITE\x20binding\x20strengths:\x0a\x20\x20//\x0a\x20\x20//\x20-\x20Bare\x20keys\x20(Escape\x20close-maximize,\x20\x27/\x27\x20focus-input,\x20\x27q\x27\x20quote-selection)\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20are\x20WEAKLY\x20bound\x20so\x20artifact\x20code\x20can\x20override\x20them:\x20the\x20listener\x20sits\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20on\x20window\x20in\x20the\x20BUBBLE\x20phase\x20—\x20the\x20last\x20handler\x20to\x20see\x20any\x20keydown\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20(capture\x20descends\x20window→target,\x20bubble\x20ascends\x20target→window)\x20—\x20and\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20skips\x20the\x20relay\x20when\x20an\x20in-frame\x20handler\x20claimed\x20the\x20key\x20via\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20preventDefault()\x20(defaultPrevented)\x20or\x20stopPropagation()\x20(the\x20event\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20then\x20never\x20arrives).\x20Essential\x20for\x20HTML\x20artifacts,\x20which\x20are\x20often\x20apps\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20with\x20their\x20own\x20ESC\x20handling;\x20a\x20no-op\x20difference\x20for\x20markdown\x20(its\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20content\x20is\x20inert).\x0a\x20\x20//\x20-\x20Bare\x20Control\x20is\x20relayed\x20UNCONDITIONALLY\x20from\x20the\x20CAPTURE\x20phase\x20so\x20the\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20parent\x27s\x20held-modifier\x20HUDs\x20(useCmdHeld\x20consumers)\x20can\x27t\x20be\x20starved\x20by\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20artifact\x20code\x20stopping\x20propagation.\x20Only\x20Control:\x20Meta/Shift/Alt\x20have\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20no\x20consumer,\x20and\x20chords\x20are\x20unshippable\x20—\x20a\x20relayed\x20chord\x20can\x27t\x20be\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20preventDefaulted\x20parent-side\x20(synthetics\x20are\x20untrusted),\x20so\x20relaying\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20chords\x20would\x20mean\x20cancelling\x20native\x20copy/select-all\x20in-frame.\x20The\x20real\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20modifier\x20flags\x20ride\x20along:\x20consumers\x20match\x20\x22strictly\x20only\x20Ctrl\x22,\x20so\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20Shift+Ctrl\x20must\x20not\x20read\x20as\x20a\x20bare\x20Ctrl\x20press.\x0a\x20\x20//\x20-\x20Clicks\x20are\x20relayed\x20UNCONDITIONALLY\x20from\x20the\x20CAPTURE\x20phase:\x20a\x20click\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20inside\x20this\x20focused\x20frame\x20never\x20reaches\x20the\x20parent\x27s\x20interaction\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20watchers,\x20so\x20the\x20completion\x20vignette\x20(and\x20its\x20derived\x20unread\x20battery\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20slot)\x20would\x20stay\x20lit.\x20ANY\x20click\x20is\x20engagement\x20evidence\x20even\x20when\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20in-frame\x20code\x20claims\x20it\x20—\x20an\x20HTML\x20app\x27s\x20stopPropagation\x20must\x20not\x20starve\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20the\x20relay\x20—\x20and\x20the\x20parent\x20side\x20never\x20cancels\x20anything\x20(it\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20re-dispatches\x20an\x20untrusted\x20synthetic\x20that\x20targets\x20no\x20element),\x20so\x20no\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20weak\x20binding\x20is\x20needed.\x20Never\x20preventDefault:\x20we\x20only\x20observe.\x0a\x20\x20//\x20-\x20Vertical\x20wheel\x20ticks\x20are\x20relayed\x20from\x20the\x20CAPTURE\x20phase\x20on\x20the\x20same\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20rationale:\x20in-frame\x20scrolling\x20(reading\x20a\x20long\x20artifact)\x20never\x20reaches\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20the\x20parent\x27s\x20watchers\x20either.\x20Vertical\x20component\x20only\x20—\x20pure-horizontal\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20wheel\x20input\x20is\x20a\x20pan,\x20not\x20the\x20reading\x20gesture\x20the\x20parent\x20counts.\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20Throttled,\x20because\x20a\x20trackpad\x20gesture\x20fires\x20wheel\x20~60x/s\x20and\x20one\x20post\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20per\x20gesture\x20is\x20all\x20dismissal\x20needs;\x20NOT\x20one-shot,\x20because\x20a\x20later\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20completion\x20re-arms\x20the\x20vignette\x20and\x20the\x20relay\x20must\x20still\x20work.\x20Never\x0a\x20\x20//\x20\x20\x20preventDefault:\x20we\x20only\x20observe.\x0a\x20\x20//\x0a\x20\x20//\x20installHotkeys\x20rides\x20__ac\x20because\x20streamSync\x27s\x20scripted\x20finalize\x0a\x20\x20//\x20(document.open)\x20erases\x20the\x20window\x27s\x20listeners\x20—\x20it\x20re-installs\x20from\x0a\x20\x20//\x20there.\x20The\x20config\x20gate\x20stays\x20as\x20a\x20safety:\x20a\x20frame\x20whose\x20config\x20carries\x0a\x20\x20//\x20no\x20wire\x20fields\x20gets\x20no\x20listeners\x20at\x20all.\x0a\x20\x20const\x20RELAYED_MODIFIER\x20=\x20\x27Control\x27;\x0a\x20\x20//\x20Burst\x20cap\x20for\x20the\x20vertical-wheel\x20engagement\x20relay:\x20a\x20trackpad\x20gesture\x0a\x20\x20//\x20fires\x20wheel\x20~60x/s;\x20one\x20post\x20per\x20window\x20is\x20all\x20the\x20parent\x27s\x20dismissal\x0a\x20\x20//\x20path\x20needs.\x20Small\x20enough\x20that\x20a\x20fresh\x20gesture\x20always\x20relays\x20promptly.\x0a\x20\x20const\x20SCROLL_RELAY_THROTTLE_MS\x20=\x20150;\x0a\x20\x20const\x20installHotkeys\x20=\x20()\x20=>\x20{\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20//\x20[Chesterton\x27s\x20Fence]\x20A\x20keydown\x20inside\x20this\x20focused\x20iframe\x20never\x20reaches\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20//\x20the\x20parent\x27s\x20held-modifier\x20listeners,\x20so\x20bare\x20Control\x20keydown/keyup\x20are\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20//\x20streamed\x20up\x20and\x20the\x20parent\x20re-dispatches\x20synthetic\x20KeyboardEvents\x20into\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20//\x20its\x20own\x20window\x20listeners.\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20if\x20(config.keyEventMsg)\x20{\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20let\x20controlForwardedDown\x20=\x20false;\x20//\x20tracks\x20what\x20WE\x20forwarded\x20—\x20blur\x20releases\x20it\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20const\x20postKeyEvent\x20=\x20(eventType,\x20{\x20ctrlKey,\x20metaKey,\x20shiftKey,\x20altKey,\x20fromBlur\x20}\x20=\x20{})\x20=>\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20post({\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20type:\x20config.keyEventMsg,\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20eventType,\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20key:\x20RELAYED_MODIFIER,\x0a\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20\x20ctrlKey:\x20Boolean(ctrlKey),\x0a\x20\x20\x20